WEBVTT

00:46:30.500 --> 00:46:32.684
I'm really inspired by your work

00:46:32.708 --> 00:46:35.458
and so grateful to you
for sharing it with us.

00:46:36.321 --> 00:46:37.893
DA: I appreciate that, thank you.

00:46:37.917 --> 00:46:40.184
I'm really glad to get a chance
to talk about it

00:46:40.208 --> 00:46:43.809
and share the knowledge
that our group has acquired

00:46:43.833 --> 00:46:45.101
over the last month.

00:46:45.125 --> 00:46:46.434
So thank you.

00:46:46.458 --> 00:46:49.839
CA: So if someone wants to keep in touch
with the progress of this idea,

00:46:49.863 --> 00:46:51.113
what should they do?

00:46:51.958 --> 00:46:55.476
DA: OK, so now I should know
our website URL by heart,

00:46:55.500 --> 00:46:58.143
but of course, I don't, I'm afraid.

00:46:58.167 --> 00:47:02.851
If somebody googles "COVID,"